%% ---- Who sees what ----------------------------------------------------------
%% Eight functional roles, and `read` is the only operation that changes what a
%% role sees. A medicinal chemist lives in the chemistry and screening data and
%% has no business in the instrument calibration log; a QA officer is the
%% reverse. Signing in as each of these is the quickest way to see that the
%% access rules are real.
